[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG]
Las Pegasus Military Industries Group (LPMIG)

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_desc]
The Las Pegasus Group is always full of unexpected surprises. At the annual Las Pegasus Security Summit, the Las Pegasus Military Industries Group always shows their customers those wonderful new equipment, whether it is a roaring machine or a magical device. The LPMIG does not mind trading with any wealthy customer, whether it is an enemy or a friend. Of course, the expensive price of their fancy products often makes less wealthy buyers hesitate and turn away. In addition, maintenance and insurance are extra charged.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG]
洛马基军工集团 (LPMIG)

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_desc]
洛马基集团总是可以带来意想不到的惊喜。一年一度的洛马基安全峰会上，洛马基军工集团总是可以向他们的客户展示那些奇妙的新装备，无论是轰轰作响的机器，还是神奇的魔法装置。洛马基军工集团不介意与任何金主的交易，无论是敌是友。当然，他们那些花里胡哨产品的昂贵价格，也常常使得不那么富裕的购买者望而却步。而且，维护和保险是额外收费的。

